BUFF'ET, v.i. To exercise or play at boxing.BUFF'ETED, pp. Struck; beaten. l Cor.4.11. l Pet.2.20.BUFF'ETER, n. One who buffets; a boxer.BUFF'ETING, ppr. Striking with the hand; boxing; contending against.

