DARE, Defiance; challenge.

DARE, n. A small fish, the same as the dace.DA'RED, pp. Challenged; defied.DA'REFUL, a. Full of defiance.DA'RING, ppr.

1. Having courage sufficient for a purpose; challenging; defying.

