1. Employed in service for a compensation; as a hired man; a hired servant.HI'RELING, n. One who is hired, or who serves for wages.

1. A mercenary; a prostitute.

HI'RELING, a. Serving for wages; venal; mercenary; employed for money or other compensation.

A tedious crew

